This repository has two licences, one for the code and one for the data I made.

Code (the .py files and the notebooks): MIT licence, below.

Data I made (the fictional reports, the photos, manifest.csv, the model answers,
the scores and the notes): Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The CARET values in data/raw/ and in the series of older results come from the
dataset psa of the R package AROC, which is under the GPL. They keep their own
licence, see data/SOURCES.md.

The models are not in this repository. Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct is under Apache 2.0
and MedGemma 1.5 4B is under the Health AI Developer Foundations terms.

